    "title": "Nicole Kidman and Ewan McGregor break into song as they reunite at the Oscars for Moulin Rouge! anniversary | HELLO!",
    "text": "Skip to main contentSkip to footer Nicole Kidman and Ewan McGregor break into song as they reunite at the Oscars for Moulin Rouge! anniversaryThe former co-stars of the iconic Baz Luhrmann film came together on Hollywood's biggest night to celebrate the film's milestone 25th anniversary Beatriz ColonNew York Writer - New YorkMarch 16, 2026Mar 16, 2026, 2:45 AM GMTLEAVE A COMMENTShare this: Nicole Kidman and Ewan McGregor have reunited on the Academy Awards stage.It's the biggest night in Hollywood, and cinephiles have been treated to several epic reunions, including between the cast of Bridesmaids, among them the nominated Rose Byrne, and the more bittersweet reunion between Meg Ryan and Billy Crystal to honor their late When Harry Met Sally director Rob Reiner.Nicole and Ewan came together for the night in honor of the 25th anniversary of their movie Moulin Rouge!, presenting the award for Best Picture, which ultimately went to One Battle After Another.HELLO! is bringing you all you need to know and watch about the Oscars, from our best dressed list, which you can find here, to our ongoing live blog featuring every winner and unmissable moment. Leave a comment Other TopicsEwan McGregorNicole KidmanMoviesOscars More USSee moreWho is Ethan Hawke's partner Ryan Shawhughes? Everything to know about his producer wifeThe Oscar-nominated star shares a powerful off-screen partnership with wife Ryan Shawhughes – from filmmaking to family life13 stars who won both Oscars and Razzies — and the one who earned them the same yearFrom Marlon Brando to Sandra Bullock, and Al Pacino and Nicole Kidman, see some of the stars who have been deemed both the best and worstWhat happened to Charlie Sheen's Wall Street co-star, Daryl Hannah, 39 years after the movie's releaseBefore there were wolves, there was simply Wall Street – but what happened to Charlie Sheen's co-star Daryl Hannah since she stepped away from the stock market?Sarah Michelle Gellar breaks silence on sad Buffy newsSarah Michelle Gellar starred as Buffy Summers in the show for seven seasons, alongside Alyson Hannigan and Anthony HeadThe late stars snubbed at the Oscars In Memoriam, including James Van Der Beek and Brigitte BardotThe In Memoriam portion of the night was especially lengthy, given the recent deaths of greats like Robert Duvall, Robert Redford, Catherine O'Hara, and Diane Keaton, among othersMeet Cybill Shepherd's three children - including actress daughter who starred in The Young and the Restless and American PieThe '70s star has built a successful and loving family of her own with several children following her lead into the spotlightWhat happened to the first female EGOT holder, Helen Hayes? Meet her two children - including famous Hawaii Five-O actor sonThe First Lady of American Theatre won all four prestigious awards, but was just as beloved by her husband and two childrenSigourney Weaver recreates her iconic Aliens line in a nostalgic Oscars momentThe sci-fi legend delighted audiences with a playful throwback as she presented at the Academy Awards Promoted Stories Read MoreBarbra Streisand performs for first time in 7 years in tear-jerking tribute to late Robert RedfordTop Gun star Kelly McGillis, 68, looks completely different nowAll about Sentimental Value star Renate Reinsve who's nominated for Oscars' Best Actress7 Hollywood couples who have both won Oscars ✕",
